<%--
Page_Scaffold - view-page shell: 2300px centered, main + optional sidebar

$ratio="8/4" - desktop main:sidebar column split (8/4, 9/3, 7/5, 6/6)

<Slot:main> - primary column content (required)
<Slot:sidebar> - entity sidebar column (optional; main spans full width when absent)

this.args.ratio - column split string, "main/side"

Owns, app-wide and nowhere else: the page max-width (2300px) with centered,
Etsy-style margins beyond it; the outer page padding (--page-pad); the
inter-column gutter (--col-gutter); and mobile column stacking (sidebar under
main). Pages author NO layout shell of their own.

Usage:
    <Page_Scaffold>
        <Slot:main>
            <Card_Widget> ...sections... </Card_Widget>
        </Slot:main>
        <Slot:sidebar>
            <Detail_Sidebar> ...kpis, fields, actions... </Detail_Sidebar>
        </Slot:sidebar>
    </Page_Scaffold>
--%>
<Define:Page_Scaffold>
    <div class="Page_Scaffold__columns" $sid="columns">
        <div class="Page_Scaffold__main" $sid="main">
            <%= content('main') %>
        </div>
        <div class="Page_Scaffold__sidebar" $sid="sidebar">
            <%= content('sidebar') %>
        </div>
    </div>
</Define:Page_Scaffold>
